pano-terminal (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix many problems inherited from GNOME Terminal: F10, the focus after
    menus, window sizes on zoom and tab switches, stopped jobs on close,
    palettes, conflicting shortcuts, link detection, and more.
  * Start the programs of tabs that are not shown yet.
  * Build on musl.

